@@ -0,0 +1,227 @@
+/*
+ * AltiVec optimizations for libjpeg-turbo
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2014-2015, D. R. Commander.
+ * Copyright (C) 2014, Jay Foad.
+ * All rights reserved.
+ * This software is provided 'as-is', without any express or implied
